{
	"itemName": "NSLOCTEXT(\"\", \"13B384C4499017DC4CC9A999518276A4\", \"Bear\")",
	"description": "NSLOCTEXT(\"[1909495A4C2095068D406C9D33F90055]\", \"5DB9E8A74B251568E6E285856F00D437\", \"Ground Mount\\r\\nLevel 5\\r\\n\\r\\n140% Ground Speed\")",
	"use": "",
	"details": "",
	"flavor": "NSLOCTEXT(\"[D20C99C24B2FABB4DC05E3BF1EE067C5]\", \"50E604B34B6CDACB4EBF50B8A4A9211E\", \"Lumbering forth with the weight of old forests and the silence of falling snow, the Brown Bear mount is a beast carved from the memory of the wild itself. Cloaked in thick, shaggy fur that ranges from sun-dappled ochre to the deep umber of rich soil, it bears the form of a great tusked boar twisted by ancient magic and bound to the shape of the bear. Its curved tusks gleam with the wear of many battles, and the heavy hump upon its back speaks of strength stored like thunder behind the clouds. Though massive in form, it moves with surprising agility, scaling trees and ledges with ease, guided by a nose that can scent danger across valleys and ears that catch whispers in the wind. Found in many lands and climates, it is a companion of the bold and the enduring, a mount that does not dazzle but endures, and in that endurance finds dominion over all terrain.\")",
